{{!
    @template core_message/unsubscribed_message

    Confirmation page shown after a user has successfully unsubscribed using
    the one-click unsubscribe link.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message - The message to show the user after unsubscribing.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "You have been unsubscribed from \"component\"."
    }
}}
